786
00:38:32.380 --> 00:38:37.000
But it got late in the day and they didn't want to move the whole crew and the cameras and

787
00:38:37.000 --> 00:38:38.520
the lighting and all that stuff.

788
00:38:38.820 --> 00:38:44.640
So right behind the lot where they shoot all the scenes where the office is, is a residential

789
00:38:44.640 --> 00:38:45.100
neighborhood.

