806
00:39:31.960 --> 00:39:33.100
It's not mine.

807
00:39:34.080 --> 00:39:37.260
So we don't know whose motorcycle it was.

808
00:39:37.260 --> 00:39:39.900
But I think that was Tom Melby's yard.

809
00:39:40.120 --> 00:39:40.960
Oh, for sure.

