00:41:37.980 --> 00:41:39.820
Oh, God, you wouldn't do it.

851
00:41:39.900 --> 00:41:43.820
You'd say, oh, right, all these women have to kiss the same guy.

852
00:41:44.300 --> 00:41:45.920
F you, patriarchy.

853
00:41:45.920 --> 00:41:47.320
He wouldn't do it.

