00:45:14.700 --> 00:45:18.920
And she goes, are you really asking me what I do with the checks that people give me?

922
00:45:19.180 --> 00:45:21.620
And he's like, I'm just I'm trying to make conversation, OK?

923
00:45:22.220 --> 00:45:22.960
Oh, Michael.

924
00:45:23.240 --> 00:45:27.080
And he just talks about like, he goes, well, this is who I was dating before you.

